  "description": "<p> </p>\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed>Omschrijving:</span><span xss=removed><br></span><span xss=removed>Compacte en krachtige </span><span xss=removed>HP Envy x360 13 inch</span><span xss=removed> laptop met </span><span xss=removed>touchscreen</span><span xss=removed> en snelle </span><span xss=removed>Intel Core i7-1165G7 processor</span><span xss=removed>. Ideaal voor werk, studie, multitasking en entertainment.</span></p>\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed>Dankzij het </span><span xss=removed>klapbare x360 design</span><span xss=removed> is de laptop ook als tablet te gebruiken. Perfect voor flexibel werken, films kijken of onderweg gebruik.</span></p>\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed>De laptop beschikt over </span><span xss=removed>16GB RAM en een snelle 512GB SSD</span><span xss=removed>, waardoor hij soepel en snel werkt bij multitasking en zwaardere programma’s.</span></p>\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed>De laptop verkeert in </span><span xss=removed>B-Grade staat</span><span xss=removed>, wat betekent dat er lichte gebruikssporen aanwezig zijn. Technisch volledig in orde en werkt perfect. De batterijconditie is </span><span xss=removed>91%</span><span xss=removed>, wat zorgt voor goede prestaties en gebruiksduur.</span></p>\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed>Wordt geleverd met </span><span xss=removed>Windows 11</span><span xss=removed>, adapter en een beschermhoes.</span></p>\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed>Specificaties:</span><span xss=removed><br></span><span xss=removed>Merk: HP</span><span xss=removed><br></span><span xss=removed>Model: Envy x360</span><span xss=removed><br></span><span xss=removed>Scherm: 13 inch touchscreen</span><span xss=removed><br></span><span xss=removed>Design: 360° klapbaar</span><span xss=removed><br></span><span xss=removed>Processor: Intel Core i7-1165G7</span><span xss=removed><br></span><span xss=removed>Werkgeheugen: 16GB RAM</span><span xss=removed><br></span><span xss=removed>Opslag: 512GB SSD</span><span xss=removed><br></span><span xss=removed>Besturingssysteem: Windows 11</span><span xss=removed><br></span><span xss=removed>Batterijconditie: 91%</span><span xss=removed><br></span><span xss=removed>Type: Convertible laptop / touchscreen</span><span xss=removed><br></span><span xss=removed>Staat: B-Grade</span></p>\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed>Wat krijg je?</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>HP Envy x360 laptop</span></li>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>Adapter / oplader</span></li>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>Beschermhoes</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed>Garantie:</span><span xss=removed><br></span><span xss=removed>3 maanden garantie</span></p>\r\n<p><span xss=removed> </span></p>",
